{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（26日）早上7時許，警方接獲一名女子報案，指其男朋友在藍田碧雲道225號康盈苑住所內暈倒。救援人員接報趕抵，證實男事主已明顯死亡。</p><p>死者姓嚴（46歲），警方將案件列作「屍體發現」處理，將安排驗屍確定死因。</p><figure><img alt=\"藍田康盈苑一名男住客在家中暈倒，當場不治。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146763371895721984452607.jpeg/sJNj8UedLQ_dkLD0KohF3KLIC2sJXkym1vBjddbwY3U\"/><figcaption>藍田康盈苑一名男住客在家中暈倒，當場不治。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T03:50:41.408271+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T03:26:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T05:34:51.339753+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T03:44:06.246125+00:00","content_hash":"0bf5bf132dbda210aaf7764827712c2f551d8f30397cda9e968f7e8ea7d21064","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}